    {
      "id": "d4831e14be06dd73",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# `SpecialTilesMap`: [[resources in Godot|Resource]]\n\nResponsible for keeping track of the XY coords for the special tiles (e.g. \"Double Letter\", \"Triple Word\" etc.)",
